# Only what the image build needs goes to the daemon. The test suites and the
# git history are the bulk of this repository and neither belongs in a build
# context. The documents are let back in below, because the site's
# documentation pages are built from them.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.next
**/.next
**/dist
**/test
docs
action
*.md
# Except what the documentation pages are built from: the documents the site
# publishes, and their images, which are under docs/assets.
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!VERSIONING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!changes
!ROADMAP.md
!DESIGN.md
!docs
.env*
.trazum
.gitea
.github
!.github/milestones.json
.claude
.agents
